Email Containment: Immediately purge/quarantine the email with subject "RE: Meeting Notes" from lars@letsdefend.io's mailbox.
Block Indicators: Add sender IP (24.213.228.54), domain (tritowncomputers.com), and file hash (11f44531fb088d31307d87b01e8eabff) to the mail gateway and EDR blocklists.



